        items: [
          "Help clients move from concept to market in compressed timelines",
          "Leverage existing assets to reduce capital investment",
          "Optimize packaging designs for real-world production conditions",
          "Successfully launched new beverage packaging systems in as little as 5 months",
        ],
      },
      {
